# A model registry in `ds4-serve spec` format: one row per servable model, 11 pipe-separated fields plus an
# optional 12th. This is the rig's single source of truth; tools/gen-swap-config.sh (llama-swap YAML) and
# tools/gen-pi-models.py (pi, OMP and Codex catalogs) both derive from it. Use it with RIG_SPEC=<this file>.
# These are the rows the author's Mac served on 2026-10-05 (per-machine KV-cache paths removed). GGUF paths are
# relative to $DS4_DIR/gguf. trust is free text and is shown in every model picker: write "verified N/M" only after
# N of M real agent runs passed through pi, "untested" otherwise.
#target|engine|family|ctx|trust|dl|label|use|gguf|vision|drafter|args
vision-500k|ds4|deepseek|500000|verified 4/4|ds4f-vision-q2|DeepSeek Vision 500k|images + very long sessions|DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp-IQ2XXS-w2Q2K-AProjQ8-SExpQ8-OutQ8.gguf|DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Encoder.gguf|DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp-DSpark-support.gguf|--prefill-chunk 2048 --kv-cache-continued-interval-tokens 65536 --kv-cache-reject-different-quant
vision-q4-400k|ds4|deepseek|400000|verified 4/4|ds4f-vision-q2-q4|DeepSeek Vision Q2/Q4 400k|images + very long sessions, higher quality|DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp-Layers37-42Q4KExperts-OtherExpertLayersIQ2XXSGateUp-Q2KDown-AProjQ8-SExpQ8-OutQ8.gguf|DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Encoder.gguf|DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp-DSpark-support.gguf|--prefill-chunk 2048 --kv-cache-continued-interval-tokens 65536 --kv-cache-reject-different-quant
